    "name": {
     "en": "Kugayama Inari Shrine",
     "ja": "久我山稲荷神社"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "Kugayama's guardian shrine. At its summer festival on 24 July a rare yudate rite is held: water is boiled in a great cauldron, and bamboo leaves dipped in it are shaken over the crowd, a custom that began with prayers to end an epidemic.",
     "ja": "久我山の鎮守。7月24日の夏祭りでは、大釜で湯を沸かし、笹の葉を浸して参拝者に振りかける、都内では珍しい湯立神事が行われる。疫病退散の祈りに始まると伝わる。"
    },
